PROVENANCE "Authored acceptance: pending manual credit hides finality; a ready part with zero pending is final even with zero denominator; a sitting additionally requires completion. Percentage visibility requires a positive denominator."

EXAMPLES disposition
  id | resultReady | scope | sittingCompleted | manualPendingQuarter | possibleQuarter -> expected
  absent-part | false | part | false | 0 | 4 -> hidden
  automatic-part | true | part | false | 0 | 4 -> final
  partial-pending | true | part | false | 2 | 4 -> provisional
  manual-only | true | part | false | 4 | 4 -> provisional
  zero-denominator-part | true | part | false | 0 | 0 -> final_no_percent
  incomplete-sitting | true | sitting | false | 0 | 16 -> provisional
  completed-sitting | true | sitting | true | 0 | 16 -> final
  completed-pending | true | sitting | true | 2 | 16 -> provisional
  zero-denominator-sitting | true | sitting | true | 0 | 0 -> final_no_percent
END
